    "detailed_description": "Step into the shoes of Wanda, a determined 17-year-old on a quest to uncover the secrets of an Polish legend. Join her as she navigates through captivating landscapes and solves intricate puzzles in this immersive point-and-click adventure game. Dive into a richly hand-drawn world teeming with mystery and magic, and accompany Wanda on a journey of self-discovery and adventure like no other. Are you ready to embark on an unforgettable quest?",
